    "https://www.folletthiring.com/": {
      "title": "Follett Jobs",
      "description": "Follett Jobs | Seasonal & Temporary Retail Jobs Home Job Opportunities Search Jobs Flexible Hours. Competitive Pay. Shape the campus experience this semester ​ ​ Search Jobs Seasonal Retail Jobs We want you to join our team!! Follett has several seasonal retail jobs available across the US and Canada ranging from short event assignments to working directly in the bookstore or warehouses. Check out the opportunities below: Bookstore Jobs Join our dynamic team to help give unforgettable experiences for students, faculty and fans! Help students find textbooks, stock product and work the cash register. Enjoy a vibrant atmosphere, flexible hours, and make a positive impact. Special Event Jobs Engage with spirited crowds, assist with retail sales, and ensure everyone has a great time. This role is perfect if you love the thrill of working sporting events and delivering excellent customer service. Barista / Café Jobs Join our team in one of our Starbucks or Café's inside the campus bookstores. You'll serve delicious drinks, connect with students, and be part of the heartbeat of campus life. Warehouse Jobs Work with a supportive team and enjoy flexible hours to pick and pack orders and price items for our bookstores. Home Job Opportunities Search Jobs Privacy Policy NXTThing RPO is an Equal Opportunity employer. NXTTHING RPO is an E-Verify employer"
    },
